  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection of Migrants Through Emergency Migration Response Centers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading the protection of vulnerable migrants through the provision of direct assistance is the main focus of the project, as in the previous phase. The project&#x2019;s objective is, &#x201C;to contribute to the efforts of the GoE to protect and empower vulnerable migrants with a focus on the most vulnerable groups&#x201D;.</narrative>
  </description>
